---
const app = 'https://app.freshskin.com/?utm_source=freshskin.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=coach';
---

<section class="sec ruled" id="coach">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="story reveal">
<div>
<span class="kicker kicker--accent">AI assistant</span>
<h2 class="display">Chat with your virtual skin coach.</h2>
</div>
<p class="story__statement">
A reminder only when it helps, and a plan that reacts to your week instead of
scolding you for it.
</p>
</div>

<div class="split split--coach">
<div class="reveal">
<ul class="coach-points">
<li>
<b>A weekly check-in</b>
<span>Seven days is enough to see whether something is working.</span>
</li>
<li>
<b>It adjusts</b>
<span>A week that goes badly changes the plan. It does not reset you.</span>
</li>
<li>
<b>No streaks</b>
<span>Nothing to break, so nothing to feel bad about.</span>
</li>
</ul>
<a class="pill pill--ghost" href={app}>Try the coach</a>
</div>

<div class="coach-chat reveal" role="img" aria-label="Sample coach conversation showing a weekly check-in reply">
<div class="coach-chat__bubble coach-chat__bubble--them">
<p>How is the barrier cream feeling this week?</p>
</div>
<div class="coach-chat__bubble coach-chat__bubble--me">
<p>A little tight after washing. Better by the evening.</p>
</div>
<div class="coach-chat__bubble coach-chat__bubble--them">
<p>That sounds like the cleanser, not the cream. Shall we try a gentler wash for seven days?</p>
</div>
<div class="coach-chat__input" aria-hidden="true">
<span>Write your check-in…</span>
<span class="coach-chat__send">↑</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
